# Using - https://github.com/Huachao/vscode-restclient

### Healthcheck endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/health

### Test cron service (requires CRON_API_KEY)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/cron/test
Authorization: Bearer generate-a-random-32-char-secret

### Test cron service - unauthorized (no token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/cron/test

### Test cron service - unauthorized (wrong token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/cron/test
Authorization: Bearer wrong-token

### Process outbox (fire-and-forget)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4000/cron/process-outbox
Authorization: Bearer generate-a-random-32-char-secret

### Process outbox - unauthorized
POST http://127.0.0.1:4000/cron/process-outbox
